{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>旅遊巴車頭毀爛。(互聯網)</figcaption></figure><p>埃及周二(20日)發生嚴重車禍，造成最少13死34傷。一輛旅遊巴士於首都開羅往南部艾斯尤特的西部沙漠公路上，撞向一輛重型貨車尾部，車頭撞至嚴重損毀。報道指巴士司機疑打瞌睡，也有指超速駕駛是肇因之一。現場可見有遺體躺在馬路上，周圍是碎片雜物。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T16:21:20.606681+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:27:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T23:58:09.084383+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:49.872109+00:00","content_hash":"a8a6940b66d2ecdd5401fec05027727eb6c96b74c2deaed381a07193fd8bfb4d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}